{
  "id": "avengers-2023-1",
  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "ASSEMBLE!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "JED MACKAY AND STORMBREAKER C.F. VILLA TAKE THE REINS OF EARTH'S MIGHTIEST HEROES!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Star. The Icon. The Witch. The Construct. The God. The Engineer. The King."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The world is ever in peril, and a new team of Avengers mobilizes to meet any dangers that dare threaten the planet. But when TERMINUS attacks, a new and insidious danger rears its head: one that the Avengers know all too well, and one that comes to them in the most dangerous of guises – that of a friend."
    }
  ],
